  abilityId: 810998
  abilityName: Fireflower
  abilityDesc: 15 combo Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP,
    boosts own critical rate), may activate BB/SBB/UBB twice for 3 turns, restores
    HP, fills OD gauge at turn's end for 3 turns, may raise allies from KO & boosts
    own max HP
